    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST AND FOLLOW US!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/d792fb946bfa029a3ad29914980554f1.poster.avif?t=1750083390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/d792fb946bfa029a3ad29914980554f1.webm?t=1750083390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/d792fb946bfa029a3ad29914980554f1.mp4?t=1750083390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memento Dawn is a colorful puzzle game in which we can control the light and shadow to help the girl find a way to get back her memories. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PUZZLE GAME FOR WHOLESOME EXPERIENCE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the girl's journey through a beautiful land where her memories are kept and help her answer the hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/60b75e2a82eab7e6b8f8730276da1b5e.avif?t=1750083390\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE BUT SIMPLE MECHANIC FOR EVERYONE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate light and shadow to create a path for the girl to go through the darkness. Collect memories to unfold a lovely story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.poster.avif?t=1750083390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.webm?t=1750083390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.mp4?t=1750083390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 80+ beautiful handcrafted levels.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique gameplay with light and shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple but deep mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint system and Undo each action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An adorable story told by charming illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing soundtracks with wholesome vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cute, family game for everyone. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memento Dawn is a colorful puzzle game in which we can control the light and shadow to help the girl find a way to get back her memories. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PUZZLE GAME FOR WHOLESOME EXPERIENCE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the girl's journey through a beautiful land where her memories are kept and help her answer the hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/60b75e2a82eab7e6b8f8730276da1b5e.avif?t=1750083390\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE BUT SIMPLE MECHANIC FOR EVERYONE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate light and shadow to create a path for the girl to go through the darkness. Collect memories to unfold a lovely story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.poster.avif?t=1750083390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.webm?t=1750083390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.mp4?t=1750083390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 80+ beautiful handcrafted levels.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique gameplay with light and shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple but deep mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint system and Undo each action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An adorable story told by charming illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing soundtracks with wholesome vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cute, family game for everyone. </p></li></ul>",
